13. Have a history of substance abuse, alcoholism, or drug use;
14. Have a history of researching drug allergies;
15. Other factors that may affect subject safety or trial compliance, as determined by researchers. Serious illnesses (including mental illnesses) that require combined treatment, severe laboratory abnormalities, or other family or social factors.

